<title>USA: McDonald's, Disney expand marketing pact.</title>
<headline>McDonald's, Disney expand marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp and Walt Disney Co, which launched an exclusive 10-year marketing alliance earlier this year, have extended their agreement to include more co-branding activities, the companies said Friday.</p>
<p>As part of the new program, two McDonald's restaurants will open in Walt Disney World Resort in Florida and another restaurant will open at Disneyland Paris.</p>
